    "detailed_description": "Discover the world of Mary Help Me in a Japanese-style platformer game, including die and retry mechanics !<br><br>Adam wakes up in a place totally unknown to him. Trying to understand what is happening to him, he realizes that he is trapped in a video game with no means of escape.<br>Panic-stricken, he wanders into this nefarious environment.<br><br>He meets Mary, a formidable ally who will help him on his adventure.<br>Nevertheless, he will have to fight for his survival, in a hostile environment with multiple enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience a <strong>2D adventure in a 3D world</strong>.<br></li><li>Collect many <strong>secrets </strong>to learn more about Adam and Mary<br></li><li><strong>Unlock the powers</strong> of the 4 elements (air, earth, water, fire) as the adventure progresses<br></li><li><strong>Boss battles</strong> with Japanese divinities</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494840/extras/71779afa39901e0fcb23f23b8f001133.avif?t=1689779295\" /></span>",
